cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This repository accompanies the ISSRE 2026 submission
  "SE-GTR: Smell Evidence-Guided Repair of Automatically Generated Unit Tests"
  (under double-blind review). Author and institutional information are
  omitted for review and will be populated at camera-ready.
title: "SE-GTR"
abstract: >-
  SE-GTR pipeline, configs, scripts, cohort definitions, and environment
  specification for the ISSRE 2026 submission. Per-project artefacts,
  JaCoCo/PIT outputs, and aggregate CSVs live in the companion Zenodo
  archive.
authors:
